{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5dc72b3e5b683974","name":"Corellian YM-2800 Limpet Ship","source":{"id":"source:reference-5dc72b3e5b683974","title":"Corellian YM-2800 Limpet Ship","revision":20611,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:11:06Z","sha256":"9a51994958e16974607ff49faf63890b225f6ad8476143cfa52c80b177c5d912","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20611","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Corellian%20YM-2800%20Limpet%20Ship&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5dc72b3e5b683974","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When the Rebellion needs to board an enemy ship quickly, few craft compare to Corellian Engineering Corporation's YM-2800 survey and mining vessel. A member of a subclass of mining vessels called limpet ships, the YM-2800 secures itself to the surface of an asteroid or planet. It uses powerful Plasma Beam Cutters and other drilling devices to blast through the rocky surface to the ore below. The Rebels use the YM-2800 to breach enemy ships so that a crew in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armored Space Suits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armored_Space_Suits"}," can board the vessel. Military vessels are assaulted on occasion, but the Rebels more often use the craft for breaching the hulls of massive bulk freighters or for cutting into Imperial bases and storehouses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Even though the YM-2800 has heavy-duty particle shielding, it does not have ray shields as standard equipment. Rebel technicians have, however, added ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Laser_Cannons"}," to provide limited self-defense. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Plasma Beam Cutter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Plasma_Beam_Cutter"}," consumes so much power that the ship loses all shielding and can fire no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"}," during the round in which the cutting beam is used. The ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"}," become functional at the start of the pilot's next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Corellian YM-2800 Limpet Ship Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -4; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 12 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 26; +12 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze