 through which a boarding party can enter. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of the Limpet Ship can make an attack with the Plasma Beam Cutter against a ship in an adjacent square. If the attack succeeds, the Limpet Ship moves into the target's space and attaches itself to the hull of the target ship without triggering a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collision"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each round thereafter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," can use the Plasma Beam Cutter to make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check and deal damage to the target ship equal to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," check's result, ignoring the target ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},". When the target ship has taken cumulative damage from the drill in excess of its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", the Limpet Ship punches through and its boarding party can enter the target ship.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
